{"title": "Skin\n | INGENIOUS", "bodyClass": "template-article template- page-width-wide card-hover-effect-none product- page- ", "html": "<main\n      id=\"MainContent\"\n      class=\"content-for-layout\"\n      role=\"main\"\n      data-page-transition-enabled=\"true\"\n      data-product-transition=\"true\"\n      data-template=\"article\"\n    >\n      <div id=\"shopify-section-template--27390868062544__section\" class=\"shopify-section section-wrapper\">\n<link href=\"/assets/0fb4d5e1-blog-details-page-section.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" media=\"all\" />\n<div class=\"section-background color-scheme-1\"></div>\n<div class=\"section color-scheme-1 blog-details-page-section\">\n  <div\n    class=\"\n      spacing-style\n      layout-panel-flex\n      layout-panel-flex--column\n      section-content-wrapper\n      mobile-column\n    \"\n    style=\"\n      --flex-direction: column; --flex-wrap: nowrap;\n\n--gap: 0px;\n\n--horizontal-alignment: ; --vertical-alignment: ;\n--vertical-alignment-mobile: ;\n\n      --padding-block-start: 0px;--padding-block-end: max(20px, calc(var(--spacing-scale) * 70px));\n    \"\n  >\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div\n    class=\"\n  image-block image-block--AOHp2RCtuMWJ3YXRpZ__blog-post-image image-block--height-fit spacing-style size-style\n blog_featured_image\"\n    style=\"\n  --ratio: 2.0515873015873014;\n  --size-style-width: 100%;--size-style-height: fit;--size-style-width-mobile: 100%; --size-style-width-mobile-min: 5rem;\n  --padding-block-start: 0px;--padding-block-end: max(20px, calc(var(--spacing-scale) * 70px));--padding-inline-start: 0px;--padding-inline-end: 0px;\n\"\n    \n  >\n    \n<img src=\"/assets/e4f1beef-Skin_09abc3eb-82e2-4885-b6f2-426a263cee4b.png\" alt=\"Skin\" width=\"1034\" height=\"504\" class=\"image-block__image border-style\" style=\"\n  --ratio: 2.0515873015873014;\n  --border-width: 1px; --border-style: none; --border-color: rgba(from\nvar(--color-border) r g b / 1.0); --border-radius:\n0px; \n\n\">\n\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    <header>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  <div \n  class=\" spacing-style text-block text-block--AU0U1T2x5aWhpaGVLO__blog-post-title h2\n    text-block--align-left\n  \"\n\n  style=\"\n    --padding-block-start: 0px; --padding-block-end:0px; \n--padding-inline-start:0px; --padding-inline-end:0px; \n\n    \n\n    --width: 100%;\n    --max-width: var(--max-width--body-normal);\n    \n      --text-align: left;\n    \n    \n  \"\n\n  \n>\n    <h1>Skin</h1>\n  </div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n    </header><div id=\"shopify-block-ATi9ob3VrbUREb1ZlN__blog-post-content\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n<div class=\"blog-post-content rte\">\n  <rte-formatter>\n    <p><strong>The body’s largest organ</strong></p>\n<p>It’s your body’s largest organ! The skin of the average woman weighs 3 kilos, while that of the average man weighs 5 kilos.</p>\n<p>The care we devote to our skin is often evident in its appearance. Some lavish an inordinate amount of time to nourish and improve it; however, more often than not it’s neglected by most.</p>\n<p>Think of skin as the protective layer that shields you from external elements (weather, pollutants, etc.) and it also represents how your body experiences and communicates with its environment by interacting with various stimuli throughout the day. In its protective capacity, the outermost layer (epidermis) can be thought of as the waterproof barrier that’s resistant to staining and is easily cleaned. Here lie stem cells that constantly produce and replace new skin cells and melanocytes (pigment-producing skin cells) that protect against UV radiation, which can be especially harmful to the next layer, the dermis. The collagen and fat located at or near the dermis is what gives your skin the plumping effect; depletion of these tissues causes the formation of wrinkles and looser appearance. As we age the amount of collagen in our skin decreases, contributing to the formation of wrinkles and other changes that make us look older; also women have less collagen than men to begin with.</p>\n<p>Within the complex environment of the skin, blood vessels, hair follicles and sweat and oil glands, an intricate system of neural, vascular, immune and chemical pathways also interdependently coexist.</p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"aligncenter wp-image-539 size-full\" src=\"/assets/c328eb64-the-skin.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"452\" height=\"301\"></p>\n<p>With this new understanding, give your skin the care and attention that it gives you!</p>\n  </rte-formatter>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"shopify-block-AMnRTcDBMNmJnaGNYK__blog-post-product\" class=\"shopify-block\">\n\n\n    <div class=\"related-product-wrapper-bg\">\n        \n                <div class=\"related-product-wrapper\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-image\">\n                        <a href=\"/products/ingenious-collagen\">\n                            \n                                <img src=\"/assets/96d72a51-Group_1073714959_copy.png\" alt=\"Collagen+\" class=\"related-product-img\">\n                            \n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n                    \n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-details\">\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <h2 class=\"related-product-title\">COLLAGEN+</h2>\n                    \n                    \n                    \n                    \n                        <p class=\"related-product-description\">HYDROLYSED MARINE COLLAGEN CAPSULES</p>\n                    \n                    \n                    <span class=\"related-product-price\">From £30</span>\n\n                    \n                    <div class=\"related-product-btn\">\n                        <a href=\"/products/ingenious-collagen\" class=\"related-product-button button\">SHOP NOW</a>\n                    </div>\n                    </div>\n    